<title>FRANCE: France sees 6.1 pct rise in winter rapeseed area.</title>
<headline>France sees 6.1 pct rise in winter rapeseed area.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French farm ministry predicted on Thursday winter sowings of rapeseed for the 1997 crop would rise by 6.1 percent.</p>
<p>In its first estimate for the new crop, the ministry said the rise would extend the winter rapeseed area to 909,000 hectares from 858,000 hectares in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
